-       `<q>`, `<sub>`, `<sup>`, `<span>`, `<bdo>` and `<iframe>`.
-   entry #FormCtrl   the HTML 4 form controls: `<input>`, `<select>`, `<textarea>`, `<label>` and `<button>`
-   entry #Inline   the inline content category: phrase, font-style, special and form-control elements, and text
-       The HTML 4 counterpart of WHATWG's `Phrasing`; includes `"#text"`.
-   entry #Lists   the list elements: `<ul>`, `<ol>`, `<dir>` and `<menu>`
-   entry #Block   the block-level content category
-       Headings, lists, `<p>`, `<pre>`, `<dl>`, `<div>`, `<noscript>`, `<blockquote>`,
-       `<form>`, `<hr>`, `<table>`, `<fieldset>`, `<address>`, `<center>`, `<isindex>` and
+       `<q>`, `<sub>`, `<sup>`, `<span>`, `<bdo>` und `<iframe>`.
+   entry #FormCtrl   die Formularsteuerelemente von HTML 4: `<input>`, `<select>`, `<textarea>`, `<label>` und `<button>`
+   entry #Inline   die Inhaltskategorie Inline: Phrasen-, Schriftstil-, Sonder- und Formularsteuerelemente sowie Text
+       Das HTML-4-Gegenstück zu `Phrasing` von WHATWG; schließt `"#text"` ein.
+   entry #Lists   die Listenelemente: `<ul>`, `<ol>`, `<dir>` und `<menu>`
+   entry #Block   die Inhaltskategorie der Blockelemente
+       Überschriften, Listen, `<p>`, `<pre>`, `<dl>`, `<div>`, `<noscript>`, `<blockquote>`,
+       `<form>`, `<hr>`, `<table>`, `<fieldset>`, `<address>`, `<center>`, `<isindex>` und

-       `<noframes>`.
